{"strongs": "H0910", "word": "בָּדָד", "translit": "ba.dad", "root": "אתת", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "isolation, separation", "definition": "בָּדָד noun [masculine] isolation, separation : Isa 27:10 עִיר בְּצוּרָה בָּדָד the fenced city is isolation , i.e. is solitary (substantive for adjective : Dr § 189. 2 ); more usually as adverb accusative, to signify alone , Deut 32:12 especially with verbs of dwelling, Lev 13:46 בָּדָד יֵשֵׁב he shall dwell alone (literally in isolation ), Jer 15:17 ; Lam 1:1 ; Lam 3:28 : figurative of freedom from attack, security Deut 33:28 (of Israel), Jer 49:31 (Kedar); so לְבָדָד Num 23:9 (Israel) Mic 7:14 ; Ps 4:9 for thou לְבָדָד לָבֶטַח תּוֺשִׁיבֵנִי makest me dwell solitarily , in safety (see Deut 33:28 ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB914')\">BDB914</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H910')\">H910</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB913')\">BDB913</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB915')\">BDB915</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>בָּדָד</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>isolation, separation</highlightword>: <ref ref=\"Isa 27:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,27,10)\">Isa 27:10</ref> <bdbheb>עִיר בְּצוּרָה בָּדָד</bdbheb> the fenced city is <highlight>isolation</highlight>, i.e. is solitary (substantive for adjective : <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup>§ 189. 2</sup></lookup>); more usually as adverb accusative, to signify <highlight>alone</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Deut 32:12\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,12)\">Deut 32:12</ref> especially with verbs of dwelling, <ref ref=\"Lev 13:46\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"46\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"46\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,46)\">Lev 13:46</ref> <bdbheb>בָּדָד יֵשֵׁב</bdbheb> he shall dwell <highlight>alone</highlight> (literally <highlight>in isolation</highlight>), <ref ref=\"Jer 15:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,15,17)\">Jer 15:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lam 1:1\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(25,1,1)\">Lam 1:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lam 3:28\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(25,3,28)\">Lam 3:28</ref>: figurative of freedom from attack, security <ref ref=\"Deut 33:28\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,28)\">Deut 33:28</ref> (of Israel), <ref ref=\"Jer 49:31\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(24,49,31)\">Jer 49:31</ref> (Kedar); so<bdbheb>לְבָדָד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 23:9\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(4,23,9)\">Num 23:9</ref> (Israel) <ref ref=\"Mic 7:14\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(33,7,14)\">Mic 7:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 4:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,4,9)\">Ps 4:9</ref> for thou <bdbheb>לְבָדָד לָבֶטַח תּוֺשִׁיבֵנִי</bdbheb> makest me dwell <highlight>solitarily</highlight>, in safety (see <ref ref=\"Deut 33:28\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,28)\">Deut 33:28</ref>). </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Isa 27:10", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 27, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Deut 32:12", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 32, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Lev 13:46", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 13, "verse": 46}, {"raw": "Jer 15:17", "book": "JER", "chapter": 15, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Lam 1:1", "book": "LAM", "chapter": 1, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Lam 3:28", "book": "LAM", "chapter": 3, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Deut 33:28", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 33, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Jer 49:31", "book": "JER", "chapter": 49, "verse": 31}, {"raw": "Num 23:9", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 23, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Mic 7:14", "book": "MIC", "chapter": 7, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Ps 4:9", "book": "PSA",